<speak>You are welcome, Mr Tan. The practical context is useful, and there is no need to apologise for taking time over it. We have kept the different subjects distinct, which is what matters for an orderly record. Before we finish, I will leave future scheduling open rather than place anything into your calendar today. When you are ready for the interface help or a routine relationship meeting, you can contact us through the usual channel. If there is an administrative matter you have not yet mentioned, there is still a moment to raise it before we end the call.</speak>